# Phase 9 Production Baseline (FROZEN)

Phase 9 Personalized Recommendation Synthesis is **production certified** and frozen at engine version **v1.1.0**.

Treat the current implementation as the regression baseline for all future counseling milestones (Phase 10+).

## Freeze contract (stable)

Phase 9 is a **deterministic recommendation synthesis layer** only.

It must **never**:

- Generate a new shortlist
- Change Phase 5 rankings / tiers / order
- Introduce new colleges
- Produce new recommendation scores
- Call an LLM
- Override comparison or shortlist decisions for ranking

It may **only**:

- Explain and synthesize existing Phase 5 recommendations
- Surface informational Comparison Insight (never changes rank)
- Apply human confidence labels derived from existing signals
- Hand off on continue to Phase 10 Future Path Vision (handoff target only; synthesis unchanged)

## Do not change unless

- Fixing a **verified bug** or **regression** against this baseline
- User explicitly requests a Phase 9 change with acknowledged freeze risk

## Frozen stage chain

```
… → concern_resolution
  → phase_9_personalized_recommendation   (FROZEN v1.1.0)
  → phase_10_future_path_vision           (FROZEN v1.0.0 — separate baseline)
  → counseling_invitation                 (Section E CTA unchanged)
  → conversation_complete
```

