## Regression baseline

- Journey: `node --test test/careerCounsellingJourney.test.js`
- Phase 9 cert: `node scripts/phase9ProductionCertification.js` (13/13 PASS)
- Engine version: `PHASE9_ENGINE_VERSION = v1.1.0`

## Later phases

- Phase 10 is separately frozen — see `.cursor/rules/phase-10-production-baseline.mdc`
- Phase 11+ must not modify Phase 9 synthesis without an explicit freeze waiver
